    "origin": "unknown",
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Five to six days after an intense battle with the Gu Yue first head, Tie Xue Leng is at death’s door. He sends out Mountain Giant Puppet Gu and Iron Fist Grappling Gu with his daughter’s safety in mind. The Iron Fist Grappling Gu turns into a giant hand and takes Tie Ruo Nan away from the mess at Qing Mao mountain. Both Gu had already been infected by Blood Frenzy Gu and turn into a pool of blood not long after completing their tasks.",
        "chapters": [
          202
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "qing-mao-extraction",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
