  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During the wolf tide, Tie Xue Leng stretches out his right hand and makes a grabbing motion toward a lightning lycan. Ripples spread in the sky, and an enormous black iron hand tears the sky apart and grabs toward the beast.",
        "chapters": [
          170
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_xue_leng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against the blood river python, Tie Xue Leng takes a deep breath and slowly extends his right hand. A ripple appears in the air before him and a giant black iron hand presses down on the python’s tail. The python struggles, and with wet scales and a slick body the iron hand slips off and bursts out with golden-red light.",
        "chapters": [
          185
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "python-grab",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later, from inside the giant puppet, he shouts and an iron hand flies out of split air, grabbing at the snake head. The iron hand shatters, but the python’s attack is stopped.",
        "chapters": [
          185
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "python-grab",
